[PIPELINE-ARCHITECTURE]
UID: PIPELINE

TITLE: e200z3 Pipeline Architecture

LOCATION: Chapter 6.3.1

ARCHITECTURE:
- 4-stage single-issue in-order pipeline
- Stages: IF (Instruction Fetch), ID (Instruction Decode), EX (Execute), WB (Write Back)
- Single-issue: Can dispatch 1 instruction per cycle
- Fully pipelined for most instructions (1 per cycle throughput)

EXECUTION_UNITS:
- Integer Execution Unit: Handles arithmetic, logical, shift, rotate operations
- Branch Unit: Handles branch instructions with 8-entry BTB
- Load/Store Unit (LSU): Handles memory operations
- Multiply Unit: Integrated in integer unit, single-cycle multiply

VALIDATION_STATUS: ✓ MATCHES
Code correctly models 4-stage pipeline with appropriate functional units.

